<title>INDIA: Indian banks closed for Good Friday.</title>
<headline>Indian banks closed for Good Friday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian banks are closed for Good Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The call money market is inactive. The market closed in the 0.25 pct to 0.50 pct range on Thursday, the last working day.</p>
<p>Normal market activity is expected to resume on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay nmewsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
